config A1599_FW_EXPLICIT_EXPERIMENT
	bool "Enable the explicit A1599 first-ready experiment entry"
	depends on EXPERT
	default n
	help
	  Build the separately named, one-shot experimental first-ready entry.
	  This does not verify A1599 DMA fabric reachability, VXD MMU behavior,
	  table visibility, or initial TLB state. Those may only be represented as
	  explicit experimental assumptions after independent review. Do not enable
	  for ordinary builds.
